<title>USA: Lincoln Electric names Massaro CEO.</title>
<headline>Lincoln Electric names Massaro CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincoln Electric Co said on Wednesday Anthony Massaro will succeed Donald Hastings as chief executive officer on November 1.</p>
<p>Hastings will remain chairman until May 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Massaro currently serves as president and chief operating officer of Lincoln Electric, which manufactures arc welding products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
